<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA MONEY MKT SHORTAGE AT 8.446 BLN RAND WED.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA MONEY MKT SHORTAGE AT 8.446 BLN RAND WED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank said the money market shortage rose to 8.446 billion rand on Wednesday from 7.985 billion rand on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
